e prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, November to December finished at 45% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February sits at 47% and February to March at 61% on the middle of the grids. Grid 17559 had its driest year in 1954 at 64%.</p>"}
